<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenia C/A surplus rises to $31.2 mln in January.</title>
<headline>Slovenia C/A surplus rises to $31.2 mln in January.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Slovenia reported the following preliminary economic indicator details for January on Friday.</p>
<p>    CURRENT ACCOUNT BALANCE    (in millions of dollars)</p>
<p>					Jan	  Dec	 Jan 96</p>
<p> Current account balance	31.2	 -4.8	 114.9</p>
<p> Merchandise trade balance   -30.7	 -66	   33</p>
<p> Exports			   621.8	 651	  653</p>
<p> Imports			   652.6	 718	  620</p>
<p>-- Novica Mihajlovic, Ljubljana newsroom, 386-61-125-8439</p>
</text>
